  "facts": [
    "Explicit callback-parent char task captures parentHitCallbackId at registration; active callback context is not carried across delay.",
    "Invocation ancestry comes from callback batch exact parentQueueId lookup in native invocation or ability producer queue census; no origin heuristic.",
    "Existing Core and character ability task helpers now bind actual tracked taskId; native immediate delay-zero character callback remains taskless.",
    "First shield DoT task remains queued before shield Add; source later binds the returned producer ID to actual installed shield instance.",
    "Recursive Core tasks inherit the actual active parent shield producer and immutable owner instance.",
    "Native Get gate identity is independently recorded; no owner-equality gameplay guard is added.",
    "Shield producer queue census requires exact active producer plus audited shield emit site, excluding inner shield hooks.",
    "Ability invocation/producer census excludes active shield producers, while unhooked Noelle fallback remains ordinary ability-producer direct damage.",
    "Native source formulas, scheduler, ordering and phase snapshot are unchanged.",
    "Stellar attack tag serialization remains lane-specific; classic file was not retained over stellar implementation."
  ],
